{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42511","headline":"奉诏赋蜀主降唐 · 牛希济","name":"奉诏赋蜀主降唐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满城文武欲朝天，不觉邻师犯塞烟。\n唐主再悬新日月，蜀王难保旧山川。\n非干将相扶持拙，自是君臣数尽年。\n古往今来亦如此，几曾欢笑几潸然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}